## Slide 4

Installation

## Slide 5

Installation Pre-Requisites

Platform Pre-Requisites
Windows Server 2012 R2/2014/2016/2019, .NET Framework and Internet Information Services.  Installation guides available on the TrakSYS Support Site.
SQL Server
Version 2012 / 2014 / 2016.  Standard or Enterprise.  Scripted install from the TrakSYS setup DVD/ISO or manual installation instructions available on the Support Site.
TrakSYS Installation Manager
After the TrakSYS files are deployed, the Installation Manager is used to configure the database, connection, services, web and other platform settings.
TrakSYS Setup
The TrakSYS setup executable deploys all the executable files to the target machine.  Additional setup options and configuration is continued from the Installation Manager.
